  "description": "Younger Man Short Story Collection Short Story 5 - Only for Noona ------ For Yeju, every time she gets engaged, something happens in her fiancé’s family and the engagement ends up being called off. This is already the third time. Forced by her father, Yeju goes on another blind date and there she reunites with Taegeon, who once lived in her house when he was a child and is eight years younger than her. Yeju had always seen him simply as a younger brother, but as Taegeon begins to approach her boldly, she slowly finds herself being swept along by him.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14328134)",
